{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the abyss, where every step confronts the darkness within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeAnima</i> is a first-person dungeon crawler that resurrects the unforgiving spirit of the original <i>Rogue</i> for a modern audience. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon steeped in dark fantasy, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About DeAnima</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Traditional Roguelike</strong>: Experience true permadeath, turn-based exploration, and randomized dungeons, heavily inspired by the game that started it all back in the 80s! Every run is a unique, merciless challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong>: Navigate a medieval dungeon with moody visuals and an oppressive atmosphere, where every shadow hides a threat or a secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Survival</strong>: Face monstrous demons with scarce resources and tough choices. Progress by mastering your environment, not overpowering it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths</strong>: Many secrets lurk in the darkness, offering paths to enlightenment or ruin. The dungeon\u2019s truths are yours to discover.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons</strong>: Explore procedurally generated labyrinths where no two runs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Permadeath</strong>: Every death is final, raising the stakes with each choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Item Discovery</strong>: Master a deep identification system to uncover the secrets of 80+ unique items, including potions, scrolls, wands, rings, and bags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Roguelike Experience</strong>: No meta-progression - every run starts from zero, testing your skill and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Time pauses with your inaction, giving you the space to plan your next move or escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Enhancement</strong>: Enchant and Vorpalize your weapons to gain a deadly edge in the dungeon\u2019s darkest depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143790?t=1769198057","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143790?t=1769198057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143790/b28de250bd88fbf8ec557d06ba980ae62aeb2a31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769198057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143790/b28de250bd88fbf8ec557d06ba980ae62aeb2a31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769198057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3753280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the abyss, where every step confronts the darkness within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeAnima</i> is a first-person dungeon crawler that resurrects the unforgiving spirit of the original <i>Rogue</i> for a modern audience. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon steeped in dark fantasy, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About DeAnima</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Traditional Roguelike</strong>: Experience true permadeath, turn-based exploration, and randomized dungeons, heavily inspired by the game that started it all back in the 80s! Every run is a unique, merciless challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong>: Navigate a medieval dungeon with moody visuals and an oppressive atmosphere, where every shadow hides a threat or a secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Survival</strong>: Face monstrous demons with scarce resources and tough choices. Progress by mastering your environment, not overpowering it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths</strong>: Many secrets lurk in the darkness, offering paths to enlightenment or ruin. The dungeon\u2019s truths are yours to discover.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons</strong>: Explore procedurally generated labyrinths where no two runs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Permadeath</strong>: Every death is final, raising the stakes with each choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Item Discovery</strong>: Master a deep identification system to uncover the secrets of 80+ unique items, including potions, scrolls, wands, rings, and bags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Roguelike Experience</strong>: No meta-progression - every run starts from zero, testing your skill and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Time pauses with your inaction, giving you the space to plan your next move or escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Enhancement</strong>: Enchant and Vorpalize your weapons to gain a deadly edge in the dungeon\u2019s darkest depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Steelgaze Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste